{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-29","kind":"proposition","title":"一直线求作依线之带馀平行方形与所设直线形等而其馀形与所设平行方形相似","englishTitle":"To a given straight line to apply a parallelogram equal to a given rectilineal figure and exceeding by a parallelogrammic figure similar to a given one.","book":6,"number":29,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.29","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.29/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":29,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-29@raw-15d3b0a61c0b627a","contentId":"euclid-6-29","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"15d3b0a61c0b627a4313ce3773a5ef4c4dcd75fad33356086557c8072cedc78e","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-29.statement","euclid-6-29.construction.1","euclid-6-29.construction.2","euclid-6-29.construction.3","euclid-6-29.proof.1","euclid-6-29.construction.4","euclid-6-29.proof.2","euclid-6-29.construction.5","euclid-6-29.proof.3","euclid-6-29.construction.6","euclid-6-29.proof.4","euclid-6-29.construction.7","euclid-6-29.proof.5","euclid-6-29.conclusion","euclid-6-29.historical.1","euclid-6-29.historical.2","euclid-6-29.historical.3","euclid-6-29.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-29.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-29","revisionId":"euclid-6-29@raw-15d3b0a61c0b627a","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b635797fa3ad60f67693af23fa685ca0ba6ab31b91b05c094b44ddf4db124953","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To a given straight line to apply a parallelogram equal to a given rectilineal figure and exceeding by a parallelogrammic figure similar to a given one."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"适用于给定直线以适用等于给定直线图的平行四边形, 并超过与给定直线图相类似的平行四边形。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线求作依线之带馀平行方形与所设直线形等而其馀形与所设平行方形相似"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"一直线求作依线之带馀平行四边形与所设直线形等而其馀形与所设平行四边形相似"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-29.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-29","revisionId":"euclid-6-29@raw-15d3b0a61c0b627a","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6b14fbae727f6ae112b3dcafd6dca03d77373add50456488818878b00537c452","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be the given straight line, C the given rectilineal figure to which the figure to be applied to AB is required to be equal, and D that to which the excess is required to be similar; thus it is required to apply to the straight line AB a parallelogram equal to the rectilineal figure C and exceeding by a parallelogrammic figure similar to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将AB线改为给定直线,将数字适用于AB直线数字为C,将超出部分定为D,因此,对直线AB a 平行四边形线适用等于直线图C,并超出类似D的平行四边形象数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-29.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-6-29","revisionId":"euclid-6-29@raw-15d3b0a61c0b627a","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"35adb015b1e63997e697a8fa0074847ad1482330790ba28dce8970d256c8c000","citations":["euclid-6-25"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be bisected at E; let there be described on EB the parallelogram BF similar and similarly situated to D; and let GH be constructed at once equal to the sum of BF, C and similar and similarly situated to D. [[VI. 25](/principles/euclid-6-25)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB在E分两部分;EB说明平行四边形 BF类似和类似,D;GH工程同时等于BF、C类似和类似,D。 [[VI. 25](/principles/euclid-6-25)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-29.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-6-29","revisionId":"euclid-6-29@raw-15d3b0a61c0b627a","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8f25805d9c87d1399107dfa32733b7fbfea2a685cda53d6c69183dab9981e2e6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let KH correspond to FL and KG to FE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让KH对应FL和KG对FE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-29.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-29","revisionId":"euclid-6-29@raw-15d3b0a61c0b627a","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"490599ab71600fc81e17a10eff422f5ff5257df98990935d7b1ae9b07bc01c3c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since GH is greater than FB, therefore KH is also greater than FL, and KG than FE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,GH超过FB,KH也超过FL,KG超过FE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-29.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-6-29","revisionId":"euclid-6-29@raw-15d3b0a61c0b627a","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7dbbb5ddb92fb13003031ad47efd314251b09537d0d5ad8f5dd553535d3609d9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let FL, FE be produced, let FLM be equal to KH, and FEN to KG, and let MN be completed; therefore MN is both equal and similar to GH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"延长FL,FE,FLM等于KH,FEN至KG,完成MN;因此,MN既等于也类似于GH。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-29.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-29","revisionId":"euclid-6-29@raw-15d3b0a61c0b627a","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ded7cbf2985f243bc4facd4bbd0fc29abbafda7307d78c10a7de491ebca9105e","citations":["euclid-6-21","euclid-6-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But GH is similar to EL; therefore MN is also similar to EL; [[VI. 21](/principles/euclid-6-21)] therefore EL is about the same diameter with MN. [[VI. 26](/principles/euclid-6-26)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但GH与EL类似,因此MN也与EL类似,因此EL直径与MN直径大致相同。 [[VI. 21](/principles/euclid-6-21)] [[VI. 26](/principles/euclid-6-26)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-29.construction.5","contentId":"euclid-6-29","revisionId":"euclid-6-29@raw-15d3b0a61c0b627a","order":7,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"17061f1449d16be133d8538ad9186d39acb7886a4468ff96c3f4801dd8f04813","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let their diameter FO be drawn, and let the figure be described."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"绘制直径FO,然后描述下图。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-29.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-6-29","revisionId":"euclid-6-29@raw-15d3b0a61c0b627a","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"26419386790b280f2d9f57231b5a0061712d5ff15ac942d9e55723ad3553f4ab","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since GH is equal to EL, C, while GH is equal to MN, therefore MN is also equal to EL, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于GH等于EL,C,GH等于MN,因此MN也等于EL,C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-29.construction.6","contentId":"euclid-6-29","revisionId":"euclid-6-29@raw-15d3b0a61c0b627a","order":9,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b804e06ee592f358c0461e8883f1f5875ed173538158b4f8d8e65d56bbaeefd1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let EL be subtracted from each; therefore the remainder, the gnomon XWV, is equal to C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"每人减去EL美元,其余曲尺形 XWV美元等于C美元。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-29.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-6-29","revisionId":"euclid-6-29@raw-15d3b0a61c0b627a","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bf1e22dfbc9577fba52f188ef6d5b325e0c9987bf2153e95e7ba9683cf4ead70","citations":["euclid-1-36","euclid-1-43"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since AE is equal to EB, AN is also equal to NB [[I. 36](/principles/euclid-1-36)], that is, to LP [[I. 43](/principles/euclid-1-43)]."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为 AE 等于 EB，所以 AN 也等于 NB，而 NB 又等于 LP。 [[I. 36](/principles/euclid-1-36)] [[I. 43](/principles/euclid-1-43)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-29.construction.7","contentId":"euclid-6-29","revisionId":"euclid-6-29@raw-15d3b0a61c0b627a","order":11,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"223aa936e0106bd10145ea12b3afd5f30ae7649b25198ae935bdd03e15d4b08b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let EO be added to each; therefore the whole AO is equal to the gnomon VWX."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"每人加EO,因此,整个AO等于曲尺形 VWX。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-29.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-6-29","revisionId":"euclid-6-29@raw-15d3b0a61c0b627a","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"00060b65cc4bb58508faa5be0efcf402316b8e6e49e510c9da5b5d779de5d0f5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the gnomon VWX is equal to C; therefore AO is also equal to C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是曲尺形 VWX等于C,因此AO也等于C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-29.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-29","revisionId":"euclid-6-29@raw-15d3b0a61c0b627a","order":13,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6ad70277e2cc6891c96db5649b87fe6d6b688648640ac98936d1c40f1c2624cd","citations":["euclid-6-24"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore to the given straight line AB there has been applied the parallelogram AO equal to the given rectilineal figure C and exceeding by a parallelogrammic figure QP which is similar to D, since PQ is also similar to EL [[VI. 24](/principles/euclid-6-24)]. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,对给定的直线AB应用了平行四边形 AO等于给定直线图C,并超过一个平行四边形QP,与D相近,因为PQ也与EL相近。 [[VI. 24](/principles/euclid-6-24)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-29.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-29","revisionId":"euclid-6-29@raw-15d3b0a61c0b627a","order":14,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"52487f4c388abbfc5d8edd5515e2d1daafd6f2699a54430e6f064d982beac32c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线求作依线之带馀平行方形与所设直线形等而其馀形与所设平行方形相似"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"一直线求作依线之带馀平行四边形与所设直线形等而其馀形与所设平行四边形相似"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-29.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-29","revisionId":"euclid-6-29@raw-15d3b0a61c0b627a","order":15,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ef59307e99ba6db70da4ecc8bf83a5eee40d07ac7ca26445ef193ae908de76d0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"法曰：甲乙线求作依线之带馀平行方形与所设直线形丙等而其馀形与所设平行方形丁相似先以甲乙线两平分于戊次于戊乙半线上作戊己庚乙平行方形与丁相似而体势等〈本篇十八〉次别作一平行方形与丙及戊庚并等为辛〈二卷十四〉次别作一平行方形与辛等又与丁相似而体势等为壬癸子丑〈本篇廿五〉其丑癸既与辛等即大于戊庚而丑癸既与戊庚相似即丑壬与壬癸两边之比例若戊己与己庚也而丑壬与壬癸两线必大于戊巳与巳庚也〈若等或小即丑癸不大于戊庚〉次于巳戊引之至卯与壬丑等于巳庚引之至寅与壬癸等而作卯寅平行方形即卯寅与丑癸同依辰巳对角线而等〈本篇廿六〉又与戊庚相似而体势等矣次于甲乙引之至巳庚乙引之至午于午卯引之至未末作甲未线与己卯平行即得甲辰带馀平行方形依甲乙线与丙等而己午为其馀形与戊庚形相似而体势等〈本篇廿四〉即与丁相似而体势等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"作图方法如下：甲乙线求作依线之带馀平行四边形与所设直线形丙等而其馀形与所设平行四边形丁相似先以甲乙线平分于戊次于戊乙半线上作戊己庚乙平行四边形与丁相似而体势等〈本篇十八〉次别作一平行四边形与丙及戊庚之和相等为辛〈二卷十四〉次别作一平行四边形与辛等又与丁相似而体势等为壬癸子丑〈本篇廿五〉其丑癸既与辛等即大于戊庚而丑癸既与戊庚相似即丑壬与壬癸两边之比例若戊己与己庚也而丑壬与壬癸两线必大于戊巳与巳庚也〈若等或小即丑癸不大于戊庚〉次于巳戊引之至卯与壬丑等于巳庚引之至寅与壬癸等而作卯寅平行四边形即卯寅与丑癸同依辰巳对角线而等〈本篇廿六〉又与戊庚相似而体势等矣次于甲乙引之至巳庚乙引之至午于午卯引之至未末作甲未线与己卯平行即得甲辰带馀平行四边形依甲乙线与丙等而己午为其馀形与戊庚形相似而体势等〈本篇廿四〉即与丁相似而体势等"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-29.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-29","revisionId":"euclid-6-29@raw-15d3b0a61c0b627a","order":16,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"82853f597b08f123e5bb2d9d286ddf872d7cf328a5ea3029790d553f4ce15295","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：甲卯戊午两形既等〈一卷卅六〉戊午与乙寅两馀方形又等〈一卷四三〉则甲卯与乙寅亦等矣而每加一卯己形则甲辰平行方形与戊辰寅罄折形亦等矣夫戊辰寅罄折形元与丙等〈丑癸即卯寅与丙及戊庚并等每减一戊庚即罄折形与〉〈丙等〉即甲辰亦与丙等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：甲卯戊午两形既等〈一卷卅六〉戊午与乙寅两馀方形又等〈一卷四三〉则甲卯与乙寅亦等矣而每加一卯己形则甲辰平行四边形与戊辰寅罄折形亦等矣夫戊辰寅罄折形元与丙等〈丑癸即卯寅与丙及戊庚之和相等每减一戊庚即罄折形与〉〈丙等〉即甲辰亦与丙等"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-29.source","contentId":"euclid-6-29","revisionId":"euclid-6-29@raw-15d3b0a61c0b627a","order":17,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"20687f58093b19337c606d1a81d31f4a65b2fcefc523859566fe3ff685414632","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.29/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.29\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-29:euclid-6-25:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-29","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-29.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-25","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.29","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.29/","sourceLabel":"VI. 25"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-29:euclid-6-21:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-29","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-29.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-21","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.29","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.29/","sourceLabel":"VI. 21"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-29:euclid-6-26:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-29","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-29.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-26","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sou